		<unit label="article" identifier="3" level="5">Registration of Lobbyists</unit>
	</structure>
	<section_number>2.2-432</section_number>
	<catch_line>Contingent compensation prohibited</catch_line>
	<text>
		It shall be unlawful for any individual to lobby for compensation that is dependent in any manner upon the outcome of any legislative or executive action.
	</text>
	<history>1994, cc. 857, 937, § 2.1-791; 2001, c. 844.</history>
</law>
